WEBVTT

00:06.460 --> 00:17.880
<b>Holy God Calendar Year 447-</b>

00:06.460 --> 00:17.880
<b>It was an age of myth, when gods, spirits, and sorcery ruled the world.</b>

00:06.460 --> 00:17.880
<b>Leonis Death Magnus, the last of the Demon Lords, reigned over the</b>

00:06.460 --> 00:17.880
<b>capital city of Necrozoa. There, the battle between the Demon Lord Army</b>

00:06.460 --> 00:17.880
<b>and the Six Heroes drew to a close.</b>

01:12.670 --> 01:15.500
The Transcendent Castle belonging to Azra-Ael,
Lord of the Underworld;

01:15.630 --> 01:17.960
the Dark Dragon Mountains
in Dragon Lord Veira's domain;

01:18.130 --> 01:22.080
and the Great Underwater Citadel belonging to
Rivaiz, Lord of the Sea, have already fallen.

01:22.630 --> 01:25.540
The Six Heroes are currently focusing
their offensive on us.

01:25.710 --> 01:29.540
Goblin Lord Dizolf and Beast Lord Gazoth
were defeated long ago.

01:29.920 --> 01:32.960
This fortress, Death Hold, is the only one remaining.

01:54.420 --> 01:56.540
Leonis...

01:57.130 --> 01:59.080
Arkael, the Great Sage...

01:59.540 --> 02:03.170
First it was Saint Tyres and Serpent Lord Ghisark...

02:03.170 --> 02:07.080
Now you, too, have forsaken your dignity
and bent a knee to the gods?

02:08.040 --> 02:11.130
I shall incinerate you with my Flames of Darkness!

02:11.710 --> 02:13.130
Hold on, Lord Magnus.

02:13.500 --> 02:15.380
You are the only Demon Lord left.

02:15.380 --> 02:18.830
The Goddess of Rebellion
does not want you to fall here, nor do I.

02:20.250 --> 02:21.920
Yes, I nearly forgot...

02:21.920 --> 02:26.080
Roselia... I must see to it that our promise is kept.

02:31.040 --> 02:35.250
Hear me, humans.
I shall graciously accept defeat this time.

02:42.960 --> 02:51.330
However, I am the Undead King. In one thousand years,
I shall rise again to reclaim my seat on the throne!

03:11.290 --> 03:12.710
Let's go over the mission.

03:12.250 --> 03:15.250
<b>The Demon Lord Returns</b>

03:12.880 --> 03:16.960
The 18th Platoon will investigate the underground ruins
that were uncovered by the earthquake

03:16.960 --> 03:18.460
and locate the Void nest therein.

03:18.460 --> 03:21.250
As a reminder, self-defense is the only form
of combat permitted.

03:21.500 --> 03:23.630
Understood. Our investigation is under way.

03:29.830 --> 03:32.670
We've arrived on the seventh floor
of the underground ruins.

03:32.880 --> 03:34.960
No magical anomalies related to Void activity.

03:35.500 --> 03:41.290
Selia, get out of there as soon as you find the nest.
Remember, it's just a scouting mission, so-

03:42.460 --> 03:45.420
Lady Selia, let's not get carried away.

03:45.420 --> 03:48.130
The return trip is going to be difficult enough as it is.

03:48.290 --> 03:52.630
Regina, Voids are the type of creatures
that build their nests deep inside underground ruins.

03:53.000 --> 03:54.830
We can't afford to let them run wild.

04:02.290 --> 04:04.880
What are these things? Statues?

04:05.750 --> 04:11.630
They're "grave goods," I believe. Objects of personal
significance that are buried with the deceased.

04:11.790 --> 04:14.880
Makes you wonder if they buried
some mega-important king nearby...

04:15.080 --> 04:17.790
Well, if this is a king's tomb...

04:18.830 --> 04:21.670
...he must be very lonely down here.

04:30.130 --> 04:33.330
This door is active! Is it some sort of magical device...?

04:37.580 --> 04:39.710
How 'bout we just bust it down?

04:39.960 --> 04:41.830
Wait... There's something written on it.

04:44.500 --> 04:49.330
Ancient Elvish? No... They're not spirit markings either...

04:49.330 --> 04:51.880
Um, is this gonna take long?

04:52.500 --> 04:53.670
Yeah, kind of.

04:53.880 --> 04:56.330
Then I'm gonna go search down that way!

04:56.540 --> 04:57.920
Sure, thanks.

05:03.130 --> 05:05.000
I feel like I've seen it before...

05:09.880 --> 05:10.540
Huh?!

05:26.250 --> 05:27.290
What is that...?

05:33.750 --> 05:36.880
A counter failure... Why'd you have to break now?

05:41.880 --> 05:43.330
There's someone inside...?

05:47.460 --> 05:48.500
I have to help them!

06:00.750 --> 06:02.630
I finally found you, Roselia!

06:05.960 --> 06:09.670
A millennium from now,
when the stars fall from the heavens...

06:11.460 --> 06:18.750
...a vessel for your power shall appear in the form
of a human child. And it is my duty to find them.

06:20.420 --> 06:23.130
Good. Just so long as you remember.

06:31.420 --> 06:33.130
Wait, Roselia-!

06:33.790 --> 06:35.420
Come and find me.

06:35.420 --> 06:36.580
Don't go!

06:39.420 --> 06:40.960
Here a doing down person what's?!

06:40.960 --> 06:43.080
What is that wretched noise...?

06:43.380 --> 06:45.040
Quick to, way I've out them either get, got!

06:44.290 --> 06:45.460
I don't understand...

06:45.960 --> 06:50.460
The magical barrier seal was supposed to have made
this mausoleum completely inaccessible...

06:47.460 --> 06:49.290
There trapped did in get manage how they to?!

06:50.710 --> 06:52.290
On, me c'mon die don't!

06:51.290 --> 06:56.460
Has it been a thousand years already?
It appears the reincarnation ritual was successful...

06:56.830 --> 06:59.250
I'm going to help you, okay? Hang tight!

07:00.210 --> 07:03.290
Stuff is this what?! Even it dent a can't I in make!

07:01.710 --> 07:03.290
Language analysis spell.

07:03.750 --> 07:06.920
This is no ordinary crystal!
I'll try an anti-materiel round next!

07:07.040 --> 07:09.580
Ah, a foolish grave robber of sorts.

07:10.330 --> 07:15.080
Then you shall suffer death as I, a Demon Lord reborn,
sear my image into your eyes!

07:15.210 --> 07:15.880
Huh?!

07:32.790 --> 07:36.210
Such beauty... A species of high elf, perhaps?

07:38.080 --> 07:40.420
No... even more beautiful.

07:42.080 --> 07:43.460
Wh-what...?

07:43.460 --> 07:47.130
Oh, that's right. I was about to inflict punishment
upon this scoundrel.

07:47.130 --> 07:49.880
How did a child end up in a place like this...?

07:50.750 --> 07:51.790
Child?

07:53.880 --> 07:55.630
P-preposterous!

07:57.540 --> 07:59.580
Did the reincarnation ritual fail?!

08:00.000 --> 08:02.330
Of all the things it could have been, why...?

08:02.630 --> 08:06.000
Why have I returned to the form I had
when I was known as Leonis the Hero?!

08:06.000 --> 08:06.960
Hey...

08:07.540 --> 08:10.080
How'd you manage to get trapped in that crystal?

08:10.080 --> 08:12.040
W-well, I...

08:14.830 --> 08:15.960
Are you hurt?

08:19.540 --> 08:22.130
The shock must be making your memories fuzzy, huh?

08:23.630 --> 08:27.250
It's going to be alright! Big Sister will keep you safe!

08:27.250 --> 08:28.830
S-stop...

08:29.790 --> 08:32.460
Showing blatant disrespect towards a Demon Lord?!

08:32.460 --> 08:36.080
A-and yet... What a pleasant sensation...

08:36.290 --> 08:38.670
Wait, what...?

08:45.210 --> 08:47.500
This biscuit has dried grapes incorporated into it...

08:47.960 --> 08:53.630
I lost my sense of taste many a century ago,
but the texture isn't bad. That being said...

08:54.170 --> 08:56.750
This body is laughably pathetic.

08:56.960 --> 09:00.210
A Demon Lord losing consciousness due to hunger?
What an embarrassment!

09:00.210 --> 09:05.080
Not only that... I can't believe I actually enjoyed
that disrespectful behavior of hers earlier...

09:05.750 --> 09:09.210
It's this absurd human form, I tell you... Utterly ridiculous!

09:09.960 --> 09:13.000
Then again, this girl did share her rations with me...

09:13.420 --> 09:15.380
I may owe her my life...

09:15.380 --> 09:16.960
Does your tummy feel better?

09:17.460 --> 09:18.080
Yes...

09:18.080 --> 09:19.000
Good!

09:20.040 --> 09:22.420
My name's Riselia Ray Crystalia.

09:22.710 --> 09:24.290
I'm a swordswoman-in-training

09:24.290 --> 09:28.630
and member of the 18th Platoon at the
Seventh Assault Garden's Excalibur Academy...

09:28.920 --> 09:30.290
Oh, and I'm 15 years old!

09:30.960 --> 09:35.000
Outside of her name and age,
I didn't understand a single word she just said...

09:35.460 --> 09:36.670
What's your name?

09:37.000 --> 09:41.790
If I had to guess, she probably thinks I'm just a child.
I can use that to my advantage.

09:41.920 --> 09:44.420
I'll try to get information on the present world out of her...

09:44.710 --> 09:49.750
Demon- um, Leonis. I'm Leonis Magnus.

09:49.960 --> 09:50.960
Leonis...

09:51.920 --> 09:54.880
A Demon Lord need not stoop so low
as to assume an alias.

09:54.880 --> 09:57.210
Plus, it's the dignified name that she gave me...

09:57.630 --> 09:59.170
Leonis, huh?

10:00.290 --> 10:04.380
I knew it. My reputation has been passed down
through the generations as an awe-inspiring legend.

10:05.130 --> 10:06.540
What an adorable name!

10:06.790 --> 10:09.040
Y-you think so?

10:09.040 --> 10:10.790
How old are you, Leo?

10:11.130 --> 10:13.540
Well, so much for my reputation...

10:13.540 --> 10:15.960
She even gave me an unsolicited nickname!

10:15.960 --> 10:18.920
About 10 years old... I think.

10:18.920 --> 10:19.710
You think?

10:19.710 --> 10:20.710
10 years old.

10:21.040 --> 10:23.710
There's no way you could've
gotten down here on your own...

10:23.710 --> 10:25.790
Somebody must've kidnapped you and locked you up.

10:26.000 --> 10:27.540
Was it a Void, by any chance?

10:27.830 --> 10:30.500
Uh, what's a "Void"...?

10:30.750 --> 10:32.500
You don't know about the Voids?

10:33.710 --> 10:36.540
Maybe you really do have some sort of amnesia...

10:44.830 --> 10:46.250
Holy Sword, activate!

10:46.540 --> 10:47.750
Drag Howl!

10:48.420 --> 10:51.960
The Voids are enemies of humanity
that suddenly appeared 64 years ago.

10:52.500 --> 10:54.540
We don't know what they are or what they want.

10:54.960 --> 10:59.500
It's said that they come from another world,
but that's just one of many theories.

10:59.790 --> 11:02.420
So we call them "Voids," as in "nothingness."

11:02.670 --> 11:06.130
That was the least enlightening explanation
I've ever heard...

11:06.540 --> 11:09.460
We came here to conduct an investigation on the Voids.

11:09.880 --> 11:12.580
Void outbreaks are pretty common in ancient ruins.

11:12.750 --> 11:13.750
Ancient...?

11:14.250 --> 11:16.500
I haven't even asked the most important question...

11:16.880 --> 11:19.710
Uh, Miss Riselia...?

11:20.000 --> 11:21.880
Call me Selia, Leo.

11:22.250 --> 11:25.290
Miss Selia, what year of the Holy God Calendar is it?

11:25.290 --> 11:27.080
Holy God Calendar...?

11:27.080 --> 11:31.830
If it's been a thousand years, then it should be
Year 1447 of the Holy God Calendar.

11:31.830 --> 11:35.290
It's Year 64 of the Unified Human Calendar...

11:35.500 --> 11:37.710
Unified Human Calendar...?

11:40.080 --> 11:41.500
Colossal Void detected!

11:41.500 --> 11:42.920
Currently engaged in combat!

11:43.040 --> 11:43.960
Regina?!

11:47.460 --> 11:48.500
Are you okay?

11:48.500 --> 11:49.790
Y-yeah...

11:49.880 --> 11:52.580
Don't worry. I promise I'll protect you.

11:52.580 --> 11:54.920
What is this strange sensation...?

11:57.790 --> 11:58.960
Safety off!

12:06.380 --> 12:07.710
An ogre-class Void?!

12:08.040 --> 12:09.500
So that's a Void...

12:09.710 --> 12:12.710
But what makes it an ogre? It looks nothing like one!

12:18.170 --> 12:22.790
The Grand Subterranean Mausoleum is where my
comrades lie... I won't allow you to desecrate it further!

12:24.040 --> 12:25.330
Stay back, Leo!

12:25.830 --> 12:29.290
D-damn it... This body is far too small!

12:32.210 --> 12:34.040
This weapon isn't doing any damage!

12:40.540 --> 12:42.580
Are you unharmed, Lady Selia?!

12:42.790 --> 12:43.880
Regina!

12:45.170 --> 12:46.420
Um, who's the kid?

12:46.580 --> 12:48.960
He's under my protection now. I'll explain later.

12:51.170 --> 12:53.580
We won't get anywhere with firepower like this...

12:53.880 --> 12:55.500
Holy Sword, mode shift!

12:55.670 --> 12:57.210
Drag Blast!

12:57.880 --> 13:00.460
What kind of weapon is that?
Did she say "Holy Sword"...?

13:01.210 --> 13:03.630
That light... It's not magic.

13:03.630 --> 13:05.250
Blow 'em to pieces!

13:06.920 --> 13:08.250
I-is it dead?!

13:08.250 --> 13:10.750
Milady, are you trying to doom us?

13:13.670 --> 13:19.210
Her weapon's output was on par with
a Phase 4 explosion spell... and yet it still stands?

13:19.750 --> 13:22.080
Head for the exit. I'll handle this thing!

13:24.750 --> 13:26.580
Fine. But be careful!

13:26.920 --> 13:28.380
Of course, milady.

13:28.750 --> 13:30.250
Let's get moving, Leo!

13:35.040 --> 13:36.920
Nothing is going according to plan...

13:36.920 --> 13:38.750
The reincarnation ritual failed.

13:38.750 --> 13:41.460
And given that I've returned in a frail human body,

13:41.460 --> 13:44.250
I'm in no position to restore my kingdom
to its former glory.

13:44.790 --> 13:48.580
To make matters worse, these so-called "Void" creatures
have wreaked havoc on my mausoleum...

13:48.830 --> 13:51.000
I'm tempted to go back there and slaughter it, but...

13:51.330 --> 13:53.130
...this girl is my only source of information.

13:53.130 --> 13:56.250
It'll be easier to get answers out of her
if I conceal my identity as a Demon Lord.

13:56.250 --> 13:58.330
We're headed for the surface, keep running!

14:06.960 --> 14:09.290
It looks like that Void had a friend...

14:12.170 --> 14:13.580
A wyvern-class...

14:13.960 --> 14:15.420
A wyvern?

14:15.420 --> 14:18.670
It does have wings, but...
otherwise, it's not even remotely the same!

14:18.830 --> 14:20.290
Leo, you need to run!

14:22.880 --> 14:23.960
Should I take it down...?

14:24.500 --> 14:28.170
She's going to get a glimpse of my power,
but I suppose it's necessary.

14:28.830 --> 14:31.880
I am a magnanimous king, but my patience has its limits.

14:31.880 --> 14:36.250
You will regret your poor decision
to set foot inside a Demon Lord's mausoleum.

14:36.790 --> 14:37.790
Now perish.

14:38.250 --> 14:39.080
Get out of here!

14:40.960 --> 14:42.130
Oh no you don't!

14:46.170 --> 14:46.880
Wha-?!

14:59.000 --> 15:00.040
Why...?

15:00.710 --> 15:02.460
Run... away...

15:09.580 --> 15:15.130
You can find Regina... and get to the surface, right?

15:20.330 --> 15:22.080
Please, hurry...!

15:26.290 --> 15:31.630
I'm sorry... I wasn't... able to... protect you...

15:36.790 --> 15:37.960
Foolish girl...

15:41.380 --> 15:45.380
You thought I wouldn't be able to withstand
that creature's weak attack, didn't you?

15:49.290 --> 15:51.170
Heroes are boring.

15:52.500 --> 15:55.420
Be mine, Leonis.

16:01.540 --> 16:04.580
Ridiculous... Utterly ridiculous.

16:06.040 --> 16:09.790
I let her live for my own amusement.
To obtain information.

16:10.500 --> 16:12.250
So then why...?

16:12.920 --> 16:19.420
Yes, yes. I'll admit it. The girl was brave,
and I may have taken a slight liking to her.

16:20.080 --> 16:22.170
Still, considering your actions...

16:22.670 --> 16:25.380
...you deserve a fate worse than death.

16:27.580 --> 16:31.630
Phase 8 gravity manipulation spell, Vira Zuo.

16:34.130 --> 16:36.500
Die, you inferior beast.

16:41.080 --> 16:44.710
Is that the best you can do?
Then allow me to make my move!

16:50.830 --> 16:52.330
You aren't going anywhere!

16:52.500 --> 16:54.210
I shall burn you to a crisp...

16:54.750 --> 16:56.420
Al Gu Belzelga!

17:05.540 --> 17:07.790
Well, that takes care of that.

17:09.670 --> 17:13.580
Preposterous! Its bones
managed to survive Phase 8 sorcery?!

17:14.380 --> 17:19.630
In this body, my magic powers are a third of the strength
they were during my heyday, at best...

17:21.040 --> 17:24.960
I am a Demon Lord.
The life of a human matters not to me.

17:25.670 --> 17:29.170
However, I must pay tribute
to a noble soul such as yours.

17:29.540 --> 17:32.290
You risked your life in an attempt to protect me.

17:32.630 --> 17:38.080
And although protecting a Demon Lord is exceedingly
ill-advised, I recognize your courage and fortitude.

17:38.750 --> 17:41.750
For one such as I, whose sorcery expertise
lies in the realm of death,

17:41.750 --> 17:44.290
I'm not even capable of rudimentary healing spells...

17:44.630 --> 17:45.920
But I'll do what I can.

18:01.750 --> 18:05.830
When she learns the truth,
I suspect she'll be angry with me...

18:06.290 --> 18:08.830
Either that, or she'll anguish over it...

18:20.000 --> 18:21.630
That's finally taken care of...

18:22.040 --> 18:24.170
Milady? Milady!

18:24.170 --> 18:27.130
Milady, do you copy?! Please, answer me!

18:27.130 --> 18:30.000
It's obviously a magical device
for long-distance communication.

18:30.000 --> 18:32.460
But I haven't the faintest idea how to use it...

18:32.670 --> 18:36.170
Who knew humans would be able to develop
such complex magical technology...?

18:42.790 --> 18:45.080
Good morning, Miss Selia.

18:48.000 --> 18:50.170
Oh, thank goodness you're alright!

18:50.420 --> 18:53.080
Shouldn't you be more worried about yourself...?

18:53.250 --> 18:55.250
Wait, what? No way!

18:55.250 --> 18:57.000
But how am I still...?!

18:57.000 --> 18:59.630
Your injuries looked worse than they actually were.

18:59.630 --> 19:03.080
So I used holy sorcery to cast a healing spell on you.

19:03.080 --> 19:04.580
"Sorcery"...?

19:04.580 --> 19:05.790
Oh, um...

19:05.960 --> 19:07.880
How can she not know what sorcery is?

19:08.580 --> 19:13.330
I get it. They can't use sorcery,
so they rely on advanced magical technology instead.

19:13.330 --> 19:16.170
Is that some sort of Holy Sword power...?

19:16.170 --> 19:18.830
Uh... is that what it is?

19:18.830 --> 19:23.830
Yeah. Excalibur Academy has documented cases
of Holy Swords with healing powers.

19:23.830 --> 19:25.630
Perhaps I should go along with it...

19:25.630 --> 19:29.210
Um, I don't know a whole lot about these powers...

19:29.210 --> 19:30.790
What exactly is a Holy Sword?

19:30.960 --> 19:34.920
Holy Swords are a type of power that arose
in us humans in order to fight the Voids.

19:35.170 --> 19:37.080
When the Voids first appeared decades ago,

19:37.080 --> 19:40.710
children who possessed mysterious abilities
began cropping up everywhere.

19:40.960 --> 19:45.330
The majority of those abilities took on the shape of
weapons, so people began calling them "Holy Swords."

19:45.580 --> 19:47.710
So the blonde-haired lady from earlier...?

19:47.830 --> 19:50.170
Drag Howl is Regina's Holy Sword.

19:50.380 --> 19:54.960
We aren't sure exactly how it works, but in most cases,
they seem to embody the personality of their wielder.

19:55.250 --> 19:57.460
Souls that physically manifest as weapons...

19:57.830 --> 20:00.750
I've yet to be blessed with a Holy Sword of my own...

20:01.170 --> 20:03.670
That's why she used a magical device to fight...

20:03.920 --> 20:05.710
Lady Selia!

20:06.670 --> 20:07.580
Regina!

20:07.580 --> 20:09.710
You're hurt! Are you alright?

20:09.710 --> 20:11.330
Oh, it's no big deal.

20:11.330 --> 20:14.080
Did you have to fight a Void, too, milady?

20:14.790 --> 20:17.210
Leo, what happened to that Void from earlier?!

20:17.500 --> 20:22.040
Well... I was shaking 'cause I got scared,
but when I looked up, it was already gone...

20:22.170 --> 20:26.210
Ah... Voids tend to behave in ways
that we don't fully understand...

20:27.540 --> 20:30.790
So, didja ever figure out who the kid is?

20:30.790 --> 20:32.420
It seems like he was abandoned.

20:32.670 --> 20:35.670
The Voids kidnapped him,
and now he's suffering from amnesia.

20:37.380 --> 20:39.130
Hop on behind me, Leo.

20:39.710 --> 20:40.670
Okay...

20:44.040 --> 20:48.080
I'm Regina Mercedes, Lady Selia's maid.
Nice to meetcha.

20:48.380 --> 20:50.210
N-nice to meet you...

20:53.000 --> 20:56.580
Milady! This kid's unusually lewd for his age!

20:56.710 --> 20:57.420
Wha-?!

20:57.420 --> 21:00.170
Don't start, Regina! I'm sure that's not true!

21:00.460 --> 21:03.080
Leo, it's going to get bumpy, so hold on tight!

21:06.290 --> 21:07.250
Hey, kid!

21:07.380 --> 21:12.130
Won't be long till we reach the city, so you might as well
enjoy holding on to Lady Selia while you can!

21:13.420 --> 21:16.500
Cut it out, Regina! Don't tease him like that, okay?

21:16.880 --> 21:19.500
Poor Leo's confused and doesn't remember much!

21:19.710 --> 21:24.130
Yeah, you're right... Sorry for teasing you, kid.

21:24.250 --> 21:26.250
Oh, don't worry about it...

21:26.420 --> 21:29.960
Y'know, a good shock
might help you get your memories back!

21:30.250 --> 21:32.080
N-no thanks...!

21:32.080 --> 21:36.080
Quit it! What if Leo ends up
turning into a boy with a dirty mind?

21:36.290 --> 21:39.790
I don't mean to be rude, but all boys have dirty minds.

21:40.210 --> 21:44.000
The almighty Undead King,
being ridiculed by a mere girl...?!

21:44.330 --> 21:48.210
It's this absurd body
and its ridiculous physiological responses!

21:52.920 --> 21:54.750
Wh-what is that?!

21:58.630 --> 22:03.830
That is humanity's last stronghold,
built in an effort to resist the Voids.

22:04.630 --> 22:08.540
The castle that houses countless Holy Swordsmen,
and the blade we use to fight back:

22:09.290 --> 22:11.080
The Seventh Assault Garden.

